1
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:21,160
Pond?

2
00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:23,680
Yeah.

3
00:01:25,140 --> 00:01:26,160
Are you drunk?

4
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:29,620
Are you actually worried about me?

5
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:33,080
Where are you?

6
00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:36,480
I don't know.

7
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:40,720
Look carefully. Where are you?

8
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:47,940
Outside your room, I think.

9
00:03:03,140 --> 00:03:06,940
EP14 Making Up

10
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,820
You're soaking wet.

11
00:03:28,820 --> 00:03:31,040
You've been out in the rain, haven't you?

12
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,740
I'm sorry.

13
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:55,220
I'm sorry for speaking harshly to you.

14
00:03:58,020 --> 00:03:59,680
Pond.

15
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:05,720
I'm sorry for saying you were easy.

16
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:09,620
I just didn't want you to leave me so easily like that.

17
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,520
I think you're drunk.

18
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:51,580
P'Dan.

19
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:54,960
I like...

20
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,680
Can you please not say it?

21
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,340
I'm afraid I won't be able to handle it.

22
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:22,260
I'm going back to Phrae tomorrow.

23
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,660
I just wanted to talk things through with you.

24
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:35,180
And to apologize to you.

25
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,780
And tell you that...

26
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,600
I think I've really fallen in love with you.

27
00:05:49,740 --> 00:05:51,520
To you...

28
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:56,300
I'm probably just someone clinging to the past.

29
00:05:58,620 --> 00:05:59,900
But to me...

30
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,060
what we had...

31
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:04,960
was truly wonderful.

32
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:11,380
Can I stay with you for one last night?

33
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:15,840
Even just a small corner of your room is enough.

34
00:06:46,100 --> 00:06:48,120
Don't come near me.

35
00:06:49,620 --> 00:06:51,400
You're so cruel.

36
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:58,700
Back off. Leave me alone.

37
00:06:58,720 --> 00:06:59,820
I'm just worried about you.

38
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:00,900
Don't be.

39
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:03,320
If you don't feel anything, don't worry about me.

40
00:07:03,780 --> 00:07:05,080
I really am worried.

41
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:06,920
Just let me walk you back to your condo, okay?

42
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,940
No need.

43
00:07:07,940 --> 00:07:09,820
Every time you walk me back...

44
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,180
it never just ends with dropping me off.

45
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,380
I'm just walking you back, really.

46
00:07:15,380 --> 00:07:16,320
No need.

47
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:19,220
I can get back on my own.

48
00:07:28,620 --> 00:07:30,440
Back off.

49
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:31,860
Walk carefully.

50
00:07:31,860 --> 00:07:32,820
No!

51
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:36,600
Just a bit more. Walk slowly.

52
00:07:41,180 --> 00:07:43,340
Careful. We're at the room now.

53
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,540
Hold on, hold on.

54
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,960
Okay.

55
00:07:53,940 --> 00:07:55,160
Take it easy.

56
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,020
Sit down here. Sit down.

57
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:00,000
Tontae.

58
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,900
Okay.

59
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:12,100
You're so cruel.

60
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,660
When you want to leave, you push me away.

61
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:18,300
When you want to come back, you pull me close.

62
00:08:20,140 --> 00:08:21,640
You're so selfish.

63
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,600
If you have no feelings for me...

64
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,860
why do you treat me like this?

65
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,300
If you don't feel anything, why do this?

66
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,880
I had my reasons for what I did.

67
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:36,420
What reasons could you possibly have?

68
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:43,040
Why can't you just make things simple?

69
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:46,160
If you like me, just tell me you like me!

70
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,740
It's not that simple, Tontae.

71
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,340
Why wouldn't it be?

72
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:53,240
Even I can do it!

73
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:56,320
I like you. I like you. I like you!

74
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,260
I've liked you for so long!

75
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:02,320
See? I can say it!

76
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:08,060
So why can't you say it?

77
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,660
I just can't.

78
00:09:09,660 --> 00:09:10,980
Why can't you?

79
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,640
I just wanted to prove something.

80
00:09:13,640 --> 00:09:15,140
What did you want to prove?

81
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:21,780
Or is it P'Ton?

82
00:09:23,180 --> 00:09:24,600
It's because of P'Ton, isn't it?

83
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,020
Fine.

84
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:28,060
I'm going to call P'Ton.

85
00:09:28,060 --> 00:09:29,280
Don't call him, Tontae.

86
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:31,020
Don't call. Put your phone away. / No, I'm calling!

87
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,360
I'm calling P'Ton!

88
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,920
I'm going to let him know...

89
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:37,100
that standing between two people who like each other...

90
00:09:37,100 --> 00:09:38,420
is a sin!

91
00:09:40,380 --> 00:09:42,140
Khun Ton didn't want us to...

92
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:44,340
He just wanted proof.

93
00:09:44,340 --> 00:09:45,960
Proof that I...

94
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,360
can take care of his brother.

95
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,700
And besides, I wanted to know...

96
00:09:48,700 --> 00:09:50,440
if you truly love me, Tontae.

97
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,660
I truly do love you!

98
00:09:53,020 --> 00:09:54,160
How do you want me to prove it?

99
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:55,520
Should we register our marriage right now?

100
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:57,120
Let's get our marriage registered tomorrow,

101
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:59,160
and have P'Ton sign as a witness!

102
00:10:00,820 --> 00:10:01,760
I think you're drunk, Tontae.

103
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:02,940
I'm not drunk!

104
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:04,880
I sobered up the moment I realized P'Ton...

105
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,320
was the reason we fought!

106
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:11,800
I'm not someone fickle.

107
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:15,240
I really like you, and I've liked you for a long time.

108
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:19,600
I liked you so much that I changed everything about myself.

109
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,760
I signed up for traditional dance.

110
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:23,680
I joined the stage play.

111
00:10:24,380 --> 00:10:26,260
I even became a drum major, all for you!

112
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:28,440
But what I should've done long ago was tell you...

113
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,020
that I've liked you all along.

114
00:10:31,820 --> 00:10:34,180
I like you! Did you hear that?

115
00:10:41,500 --> 00:10:43,000
You're P'Best, not P'Shone!

116
00:10:43,740 --> 00:10:45,640
You have no right to talk.

117
00:10:46,020 --> 00:10:48,020
The only thing you're allowed to say to me...

118
00:10:48,020 --> 00:10:49,620
is an apology!

119
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:54,020
I'm sorry.

120
00:10:57,580 --> 00:10:58,120
Tontae...

121
00:10:59,160 --> 00:10:59,620
Stop.

122
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:01,600
You wanted proof, right?

123
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,940
You wanted to stay away from me, right?

124
00:11:03,940 --> 00:11:04,720
Fine.

125
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:08,380
From now on,

126
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:09,860
you must stay away from me...

127
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:11,340
by two meters.

128
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,000
Change that.

129
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,860
1.15 meters.

130
00:11:15,860 --> 00:11:17,860
My lucky number is seven.

131
00:11:18,180 --> 00:11:19,740
1 + 1 + 5 equals 7.

132
00:11:20,880 --> 00:11:23,920
You wanted space, right? Then keep your space!

133
00:11:25,820 --> 00:11:26,680
Tontae, I...

134
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,980
Stop! Don't come in.

135
00:11:27,980 --> 00:11:29,440
You wanted distance so badly, right?

136
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:32,140
Stay 1.15 meters away from me!

137
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:36,720
Tontae...

138
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:37,980
Apologize again.

139
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:39,780
I'm sorry.

140
00:11:41,420 --> 00:11:43,980
Stay 1.15 meters away!

141
00:12:09,500 --> 00:12:10,220
Why...

142
00:12:10,220 --> 00:12:12,180
Why did you bring me here?

143
00:12:14,560 --> 00:12:16,940
How am I supposed to move on?

144
00:12:22,700 --> 00:14:24,240
but the reason I came all this way...

145
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,580
You're capable.

146
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:27,140
You have a bright future.

147
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:29,480
A future without you in it, huh?

148
00:12:33,820 --> 00:12:34,780
From now on...

149
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:37,900
I guess I can finally call you my ex without hesitation.

150
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:42,940
Can I ask you something?

151
00:12:45,380 --> 00:12:47,020
Why didn't you love me?

152
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:53,000
Did I ever say that?

153
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:57,720
But you acted like you never loved me at all.

154
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:04,400
You probably love him more.

155
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:11,480
If you're talking about Tang-Oh...

156
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:14,240
he and I have only ever been friends.

157
00:13:17,060 --> 00:13:18,720
Then I really blew it, didn't I?

158
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:21,700
If we had just talked that day...

159
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:25,380
things wouldn't have ended up like this.

160
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:29,340
Even without what happened that day,

161
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:33,080
it still might have been hard for us to work out.

162
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,000
Honestly,

163
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:49,580
you and Kaen seem...

164
00:13:51,380 --> 00:13:52,980
good together.

165
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,140
Same age.

166
00:13:56,140 --> 00:13:57,740
Similar interests.

167
00:13:59,420 --> 00:14:00,940
Growing up together.

168
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,540
He suits you better than I do.

169
00:14:05,260 --> 00:14:07,400
But I don't feel anything for Kaen.

170
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,720
The one I have feelings for...

171
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,780
is you.

172
00:14:20,060 --> 00:14:22,200
I don't know how much you believe me,

173
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:27,580
was because I wanted to prove it to you.

174
00:14:29,820 --> 00:14:32,040
Yet I ruined it all over again.

175
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:38,060
Maybe you're not the one who ruined it.

176
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:41,680
Yet you never loved me.

177
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:55,660
If I didn't love you, why would I be sitting right here?

178
00:14:58,260 --> 00:15:00,220
What?

179
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:05,220
It's late. I have to...

180
00:15:05,220 --> 00:15:06,780
get to work now.

181
00:15:10,260 --> 00:15:11,460
P'...

182
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:15,700
I'm just a boy...

183
00:15:15,940 --> 00:15:18,100
standing in front of you once again,

184
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:19,760
hoping that you...

185
00:15:19,760 --> 00:15:22,300
will love me again.

186
00:15:28,340 --> 00:15:30,280
Can you let that person go?

187
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:33,860
If he isn't your new boyfriend,

188
00:15:35,380 --> 00:15:37,080
can I be the one?

189
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:57,300
Yeah.

190
00:16:17,500 --> 00:16:18,740
Seriously,

191
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:21,980
do you really think all this work will help P'Dan?

192
00:16:24,860 --> 00:16:26,180
What?

193
00:16:28,940 --> 00:16:32,520
Burying yourself in work won't help you forget...

194
00:16:33,340 --> 00:16:34,860
about your love.

195
00:16:35,660 --> 00:16:37,220
I never thought I'd forget anyway.

196
00:16:37,420 --> 00:16:37,960
Hold on.

197
00:16:38,520 --> 00:16:39,560
You're not going to forget?

198
00:16:41,380 --> 00:16:43,380
What about you? Sitting so far away,

199
00:16:43,380 --> 00:16:45,600
and what's with that measuring tape anyway?

200
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:46,760
Leave me alone.

201
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:48,740
I'm keeping my distance.

202
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:53,140
You can't come within 1 meter and 15 cm of me.

203
00:16:53,540 --> 00:16:54,940
Go on, get out.

204
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:55,900
Move back.

205
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,580
I'm going crazy.

206
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,660
At first,

207
00:17:03,180 --> 00:17:06,020
I thought I couldn't reach the goal Khun Ton set.

208
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,520
But seeing you in this state,

209
00:17:08,780 --> 00:17:10,240
gives me some hope.

210
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,500
I really have to thank Pond

211
00:17:13,740 --> 00:17:15,200
for leaving without saying goodbye.

212
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:17,920
Wait... He didn't say goodbye to you?

213
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:18,420
What?

214
00:17:18,940 --> 00:17:20,160
Did he say goodbye to you, then?

215
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:25,700
Don't tell me...

216
00:17:26,360 --> 00:17:28,660
he dragged himself through the rain just to say goodbye to you?

217
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:32,980
You're acting suspicious.

218
00:17:33,500 --> 00:17:35,880
Or is there something we don't know?

219
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:36,720
Exactly.

220
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:41,600
I'm the one who doesn't know—like when you two will make up!

221
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:46,160
No, we haven't made up! Don't come near me. That's 1 meter 15 cm!

222
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,200
Don't come near me yet!

223
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:52,420
Oh wow...

224
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:56,140
It was already bad before, but with him gone,

225
00:17:56,460 --> 00:17:57,820
it looks even worse, doesn't it?

226
00:17:58,640 --> 00:17:59,600
Sis...

227
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:00,400
It's true!

228
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:02,020
Hey.

229
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:05,720
Just between us, I've already sent him an offer letter.

230
00:18:06,020 --> 00:18:07,140
And what did he say, Sis?

231
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:08,580
No reply.

232
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:11,400
He's very talented.

233
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,960
He can probably pick any job he wants.

234
00:18:13,620 --> 00:18:14,660
But if you ask me,

235
00:18:14,660 --> 00:18:16,140
if he really has to choose,

236
00:18:16,140 --> 00:18:18,020
he'll choose to work here.

237
00:18:18,020 --> 00:18:19,140
Know why?

238
00:18:19,140 --> 00:18:20,980
Because his heart...

239
00:18:20,980 --> 00:18:22,440
is right here.

240
00:18:23,540 --> 00:18:24,460
He won't come.

241
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:29,380
On second thought, if it were me, I might not come either.

242
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:30,880
Once is tolerable.

243
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,500
A second or third time?

244
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:33,440
No way.

245
00:18:35,100 --> 00:18:37,740
Look who's talking! You hit on P'Best three times!

246
00:18:37,740 --> 00:18:39,200
This time, I didn't hit on him.

247
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:42,240
P'Best came after me! Step back 1 meter 15!

248
00:18:42,660 --> 00:18:44,540
But it's been three months already.

249
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:46,220
Haven't you softened up at all?

250
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:49,180
No, I'm not softening up. I'm keeping my distance.

251
00:18:49,180 --> 00:18:51,820
I'll only stop being mad and sulking when...

252
00:18:51,820 --> 00:18:53,120
P'Dan and Pond...

253
00:18:53,700 --> 00:18:55,080
make up and get back together.

254
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,200
If it's about that...

255
00:18:59,140 --> 00:19:00,600
that day might never come.

256
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:03,480
Suspicious! Very suspicious!

257
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,760
Nothing suspicious.

258
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,720
You are suspicious!

259
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:08,320
I'm not...

260
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:16,060
Share your thoughts on "New Boyfriend"!

261
00:19:16,060 --> 00:19:18,540
Leave a comment with your impressions under this video,

262
00:19:18,540 --> 00:19:21,280
and share it on any of your social media platforms

263
